    {
      "text": "CEQA Notice of Determination: on 2025-12-02 the Pacifica City Council, on call-up from the Planning Commission, approved a General Plan amendment, Site Development Permit, Vesting Tentative Map, Use Permit, Tree Removal Permit, Sign Permit and Parking Exception, and introduced rezoning and Development Agreement ordinances. An EIR was prepared and a Statement of Overriding Considerations adopted.",
