      "text": "Condominium subdivision of one commercial condominium and 19 residential condominiums. SF YIMBY (2021): Building A has 3,165 sq ft of ground-floor commercial and three residential units above; Building B has seven townhomes and Building C nine townhomes; units from under 950 sq ft to over 2,200 sq ft; three affordable units under the city's inclusionary ordinance.",
